This site's design adapts techniques from the website of shad0w
(https://2796gaurav.github.io/shad0w/, source https://github.com/2796gaurav/shad0w),
which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Adapted, not copied: the palette's
structure (a near-black base with a deep navy family and one warm accent), hard
offset shadows that settle on hover, pointer-following spotlights, staggered
reveals with a time-out, number tickers, and section spacing. No text, images or
code files are copied from it.
